---
import Faq from "./Faq.astro";
---

<!-- ============ MANIFIESTO ============ -->
<section class="paper" id="historia">
  <div class="paper-inner">
    <div class="mani-copy">
      <p class="sec-kicker dark rv" data-i18n="mani.kicker">MANIFESTO</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title dark rv" data-delay="80" data-i18n-html="mani.title">CURIOSITY,<br>BUT <em class="hl">PHYSICAL.</em></h2>
      <p class="mani-text rv" data-delay="160" data-i18n-html="mani.text">SnackRabbit was born telling 60-second curiosities. <strong>DROP 001</strong> is exactly the same, but in objects: a can that doesn't lie to you, a towel that has seen more scrolling than sweat, and a plush bunny that watches you work.</p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li class="rv" data-delay="220" data-i18n="mani.fact1">YERBA MATE HAS MORE ANTIOXIDANTS THAN GREEN TEA.</li>
        <li class="rv" data-delay="300" data-i18n="mani.fact2">A GUARANÁ SEED PACKS ~2× THE CAFFEINE OF A COFFEE BEAN.</li>
        <li class="rv" data-delay="380" data-i18n="mani.fact3">RABBITS CAN SEE ALMOST 360°. WE CAN ONLY SEE THIS DROP.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <figure class="mani-sticker rv" data-delay="200" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/logo-snackrabbit-rosa-1080.png" alt="">
      <span class="hv-tape hv-tape-a"></span>
      <figcaption>EST. 2026 · 100% REAL</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <Faq />
</section>
